WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:17.833
Kep was still sleeping under the tree.

2
00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:20.450
"Benjamin," Peter whispered.

3
00:00:20.451 --> 00:00:22.369
"Let's go to the field.

4
00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:33.303
We can play tag now."

5
00:00:33.304 --> 00:00:36.433
The bunnies hopped back to the field.

6
00:00:36.434 --> 00:00:40.635
A lamb followed them.

7
00:00:40.636 --> 00:00:43.981
"Baa!"

8
00:00:43.982 --> 00:00:47.172
"Go away, lamb!" Benjamin said.

9
00:00:47.173 --> 00:00:49.604
"You can’t play with us!"

10
00:00:49.605 --> 00:00:53.225
"Baa!" the lamb said.

11
00:00:53.226 --> 00:00:56.226
It hopped and skipped.

12
00:00:56.227 --> 00:01:00.898
It wanted to play.

13
00:01:00.899 --> 00:01:03.977
Peter saw something across the field.

14
00:01:03.978 --> 00:01:08.388
"Look!" he cried. "The fox!"

15
00:01:08.389 --> 00:01:11.710
"Oh no!" Benjamin said.

16
00:01:11.711 --> 00:01:15.533
"What should we do?" Peter whispered.

17
00:01:15.534 --> 00:01:18.002
"Hide!" Benjamin said.

18
00:01:18.003 --> 00:01:20.861
The bunnies hid in the tall grass.

19
00:01:20.862 --> 00:01:25.150
But the lamb was still playing.

20
00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:27.778
The fox came closer.

21
00:01:27.779 --> 00:01:30.461
He did not see the bunnies.

22
00:01:30.462 --> 00:01:33.305
But the fox saw the lamb!

23
00:01:33.306 --> 00:01:37.916
"Uh-oh!" Benjamin whispered.

24
00:01:37.917 --> 00:01:40.152
Peter looked at Kep.

25
00:01:40.153 --> 00:01:46.178
The dog was still sound asleep.

26
00:01:46.179 --> 00:01:49.941
Peter gulped.

27
00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:57.971
"We're in big trouble!"
